    "body": "Closes #59.\n\nImplements is_valid_url() in src/base/url.cpp, a pure function that checks whether a string looks like a valid URL.\n\n## Accepted schemes\n- `http`\n- `https`\n- `file`\n\n## Validation rules\n- Non-empty string\n- No spaces\n- Must start with a supported scheme\n- Must have content after the scheme\n- For http and https, host cannot start with a slash\n\n## Tests\nAdds tests/test_url.cpp with 4 test cases and 17 assertions, covering both valid and invalid URLs.\n\n## Build\n- Adds `base/url.cpp` to `honeybee_lib` in `src/CMakeLists.txt`\n- Adds `test_url.cpp` to `honeybee_tests` in `tests/CMakeLists.txt`\n\n## Verification\nBuilds and passes locally:\n- `ninja` completes with 10 steps\n- `ctest` reports all tests passed\n- `honeybee_tests` reports 17 assertions in 4 test cases",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-28T06:47:51Z",
